# Implementation Plan - AI Disease Prediction & Health Assistant

Build a production-grade, full-stack AI/ML Web Application for Disease Prediction and Health Information guidance using FastAPI backend, Scikit-Learn/XGBoost ML pipeline with Explainable AI (SHAP/Feature Importance), Streamlit interactive frontend, and SQLite/Supabase PostgreSQL database storage.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Medical Disclaimer & Safety Boundary**:
> The application strictly functions as an educational decision-support tool. It will include explicit disclaimers on every prediction page and emergency notices when critical symptoms (e.g., chest pain, severe dyspnea, sudden numbness) are selected.

> [!NOTE]
> **Dual Storage Architecture**:
> To ensure the application works out-of-the-box locally without requiring external cloud database setup, backend data storage will use an auto-initializing SQLite database (`database/app.db`) populated with realistic seed dataset and disease knowledge base, with seamless compatibility for Supabase PostgreSQL via `.env` configuration.

